      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "NON-FUNCTIONAL\n• 60 FPS during common interactions\n• Input response ≈ <100 ms\n• Incremental interactivity\n• Bounded memory\n• Accessible keyboard navigation\n• Recover from worker/render failures\n• No lost edits",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NON-FUNCTIONAL\n• 60 FPS during common interactions\n• Input response ≈ <100 ms\n• Incremental interactivity\n• Bounded memory\n• Accessible keyboard navigation\n• Recover from worker/render failures\n• No lost edits",
      "autoResize": false,
