      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "SCALE ASSUMPTIONS\n• 100K total objects\n• 20–200 typically visible\n• 1K–5K visible worst case\n• 10K+ expanded tree rows\n• Pointer events > display FPS\n• Large assets via CDN\n• Autosave every few seconds",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SCALE ASSUMPTIONS\n• 100K total objects\n• 20–200 typically visible\n• 1K–5K visible worst case\n• 10K+ expanded tree rows\n• Pointer events > display FPS\n• Large assets via CDN\n• Autosave every few seconds",
