    {
      "id": "render_choice",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 95,
      "y": 1295,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 361.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ak",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 973691210,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 1616127259,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785948373133,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "TECHNOLOGY CHOICE\nDOM/SVG\n+ semantic, CSS, simple hit testing\n– too many nodes, style/layout cost\n\nCanvas 2D\n+ simpler, strong default\n– CPU-bound for heavy compositing\n\nWebGL\n+ GPU batching, effects, huge scenes\n– text/context-loss complexity\n\nDECISION\nReact for shell + virtualized DOM tree.\nCanvas first; WebGL where profiling or\neffects justify it.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TECHNOLOGY CHOICE\nDOM/SVG\n+ semantic, CSS, simple hit testing\n– too many nodes, style/layout cost\n\nCanvas 2D\n+ simpler, strong default\n– CPU-bound for heavy compositing\n\nWebGL\n+ GPU batching, effects, huge scenes\n– text/context-loss complexity\n\nDECISION\nReact for shell + virtualized DOM tree.\nCanvas first; WebGL where profiling or effects justify it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pipeline",
