      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "screen point\n→ world point\n→ spatial-index candidates\n→ topmost z-order\n→ precise geometry test\n\nNo per-object DOM listeners.\nUse canvas-level delegation.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "screen point\n→ world point\n→ spatial-index candidates\n→ topmost z-order\n→ precise geometry test\n\nNo per-object DOM listeners.\nUse canvas-level delegation.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
