      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "VIRTUAL TREE\n• Flatten only expanded nodes\n• Render visible range + overscan\n• Selection keyed by object ID\n• aria-activedescendant on persistent\ncontainer\n• Arrow keys, Home/End, range select\n• Variable height → measurement cache +\nprefix sums",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VIRTUAL TREE\n• Flatten only expanded nodes\n• Render visible range + overscan\n• Selection keyed by object ID\n• aria-activedescendant on persistent container\n• Arrow keys, Home/End, range select\n• Variable height → measurement cache + prefix sums",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
