      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "EXPANDING 50K CHILDREN\n• Compute in worker or chunks\n• Yield to main thread\n• Render first visible range\nimmediately\n• Lazy-load child metadata\n• Never build 50K React elements",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EXPANDING 50K CHILDREN\n• Compute in worker or chunks\n• Yield to main thread\n• Render first visible range immediately\n• Lazy-load child metadata\n• Never build 50K React elements",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
