      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785948592939,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "UNDO / REDO\nUse commands or inverse operations, not\nfull snapshots.\n\nMove operation:\nbefore {x:100,y:200}\nafter  {x:500,y:300}\n\nGesture coalescing:\n100 pointer moves → 1 command\n20 keystrokes / 500ms → 1 text command\n\nBenefits:\n• memory proportional to changed data\n• persistence-friendly\n• collaboration-friendly",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UNDO / REDO\nUse commands or inverse operations, not full snapshots.\n\nMove operation:\nbefore {x:100,y:200}\nafter  {x:500,y:300}\n\nGesture coalescing:\n100 pointer moves → 1 command\n20 keystrokes / 500ms → 1 text command\n\nBenefits:\n• memory proportional to changed data\n• persistence-friendly\n• collaboration-friendly",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "loading",
