      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785947425146,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "FAILURE MODES\nWebGL context loss\n→ recreate shaders/resources\n\nWorker crash\n→ restart + rebuild from latest revision\n\nAsset failure\n→ placeholder + retry, never block scene\n\nSave failure\n→ keep local op queue\n→ idempotent retry\n→ clear unsaved indicator only after ACK",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FAILURE MODES\nWebGL context loss\n→ recreate shaders/resources\n\nWorker crash\n→ restart + rebuild from latest revision\n\nAsset failure\n→ placeholder + retry, never block scene\n\nSave failure\n→ keep local op queue\n→ idempotent retry\n→ clear unsaved indicator only after ACK",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
