      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "MEASURE\n• frame duration / dropped frames\n• input latency / INP\n• React commit duration\n• visible-object count\n• spatial-index query time\n• worker queue depth\n• long tasks\n• image/texture memory\n• time to document interactive",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MEASURE\n• frame duration / dropped frames\n• input latency / INP\n• React commit duration\n• visible-object count\n• spatial-index query time\n• worker queue depth\n• long tasks\n• image/texture memory\n• time to document interactive",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
