      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "7. DEEP-DIVE QUESTIONS",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. DEEP-DIVE QUESTIONS",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "questions",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1717.8340517902145,
      "y": 2608.459214669397,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 233.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0D",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 568825840,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 510363624,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785949472367,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "INTERVIEWER DEEP DIVES\n1. Why not render everything once?\n2. What if an offscreen layer is selected?\n3. How do variable row heights work?\n4. How do you expand a 50K-child group?\n5. How is canvas content accessible?\n6. What changes for collaboration?\n7. How do you avoid stale worker results?\n8. How do you recover after WebGL context loss?\n9. How do you bound memory?\n10. When do you choose Canvas vs WebGL?",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "INTERVIEWER DEEP DIVES\n1. Why not render everything once?\n2. What if an offscreen layer is selected?\n3. How do variable row heights work?\n4. How do you expand a 50K-child group?\n5. How is canvas content accessible?\n6. What changes for collaboration?\n7. How do you avoid stale worker results?\n8. How do you recover after WebGL context loss?\n9. How do you bound memory?\n10. When do you choose Canvas vs WebGL?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Djlkxe5wUcXH5kQOKV7UT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 959.0912016114676,
      "y": -136.654162272113,
      "width": 759,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1205688984,
      "version": 77,
      "versionNonce": 1769157864,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785948663896,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KEY DECISIONS\n• Do not render 100K React/DOM nodes\n• Separate committed state from transient gestures\n• Use spatial indexing to make work proportional to K visible objects\n• Use Canvas first; graduate to WebGL for measured need\n• Virtualize the tree independently from canvas rendering\n• Worker for CPU-heavy derived data, not as a dumping ground\n• Preserve accessibility with a semantic DOM control plane\n• Operation log enables undo, autosave, collaboration, replay",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KEY DECISIONS\n• Do not render 100K React/DOM nodes\n• Separate committed state from transient gestures\n• Use spatial indexing to make work proportional to K visible objects\n• Use Canvas first; graduate to WebGL for measured need\n• Virtualize the tree independently from canvas rendering\n• Worker for CPU-heavy derived data, not as a dumping ground\n• Preserve accessibility with a semantic DOM control plane\n• Operation log enables undo, autosave, collaboration, replay",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
